  pages:
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1da884bb810dc2c408e6b340c781e162, type: 3}
    title: Quest Notification
    body: Whenever you receive a quest, complete a quest, or fail a quest, you will
      see this notification. It tells you the name of your quest and what to do.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9f3da548b917c9c4480e4cc0006daee8, type: 3}
    title: Different Colors
    body: "The band at left has three different colors and corresponding meanings.
      \nBlue means it's a new quest. Green means you complete a quest. Red means
      you fail a quest."
  - screenshot: {fileID: -7469096589320162694, guid: b6ced1d421ed0754090ca1ed96fbdb2b, type: 3}
    title: Tracker Panel
    body: You can check your quest at the quest track panel. Hover on to see more
      details.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d53e4a9e966553b46aee1a0a693a216c, type: 3}
    title: Log Panel
    body: Clicking on any of the quest showing on track panel leads you to the quest
      log panel, where you can see all the quests you have met and more detailed
      information.
